# Project masters stay local. The site only ever serves the derivatives in
# media/, which ARE committed, so the published gallery is complete without
# shipping 286 MB of 24-megapixel originals to a public repo.
#
# Consequence: a fresh clone cannot re-run `python tools/build.py` for these
# projects without the originals. Keep them backed up (they live in
# C:\VARUN\Photos and in OneDrive) — media/ cannot be regenerated from git alone.
Photos/projects/

# Seven loose originals dropped straight into Photos/ root as 1-1..1-7. They are
# a second copy of the Cobalt shoot (now a project) plus one extra frame, are
# not listed in content/photos.meta.json, and so never appear on the site. The
# build reports them on every run. Untracked so ~103 MB of 24-megapixel masters
# do not sit in a public repo for files nothing references.
/Photos/1-*.jpg

# Local scratch
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
